				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Yeah, it's very difficult to comapre Emmitt to Barry because they had very different styles. I don't think Barry would have done nearly as well on a team like Dallas because of the type of offensive linemen the Cowboys had. They didn't have quick linemen who could run pulls and help the RB get to the outside, they had big, fat, powerful guards who just shoved the defence back and created holes up the middle. And you need a power back to burst through those holes, not a speed guy.</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
